# Sweet Home Reset does not commit secrets.
# Copy the examples below and fill them in on your machine. Leave a value empty until Blake provides it.
#
# Web (Vite):  cp apps/web/.env.example apps/web/.env
# API (Wrangler, local only):  cp apps/api/.dev.vars.example apps/api/.dev.vars
# Then chmod 600 the copies.
#
# Deployed Worker secrets are set with `wrangler secret put NAME`.
# Never put a secret in wrangler.toml, source, docs, or chat.
